repository-code: "https://github.com/StutiiiG/data-center-impact"
url: "https://data-center-map-nu1d.onrender.com/"

abstract: >
  An interactive visualization framework for exploring indirect environmental
  impacts associated with data center electricity demand in the United States,
  including power consumption, carbon emissions, water footprint, and ambient
  air quality. The project integrates public datasets and scenario-based
  projections to support spatial and comparative analysis.

keywords:
  - data centers
  - environmental impact
  - electricity grids
  - carbon emissions
  - water footprint
  - air quality
  - geospatial visualization

